{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_06",
  "title": "Additional Ticket",
  "storyCode": "RS-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe2f54f921304329e4f38de5dfad6ff7807b8aefa45d7bba655d94b86dc2093b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'm not a rotten girl!\nI-I won't let you call me that...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If you wanna fight, you'll get one! I'm not scared of you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'm not a bad kid!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'm fine with just my mamochka, I don't need a papa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I don't need a..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Didn't expect I'd fall headfirst into them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The trees... they were here all along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Two trees growing into each other, this has to be them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Okay, that should do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that mom's business is done, I'll..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nope, can't climb back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The snow's too thick, and the hill's too steep to make it back up with my bare hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's only this cliff here left to try..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W-Wait, Rosalind!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*cough*, *cough* *cough*!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get away from there, it's dangerous!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, okay, I'm getting away! You stay put too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can't move your legs, right? Just take a rest and don't push yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just a scratch. Not like I'd ever let you fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those Victorian bastards actually dragged you into their plans... I won't let them get away with it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So that guy's really a Victorian spy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He, well... he didn't actually do anything to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It'll be too late when he does!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd have beat him so badly he wouldn't dare to set foot on Paleroche land ever again, if only we didn't have such bad luck!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Before you came out of nowhere, I was about to tie the bastard up and teach him a lesson!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whatever, let's just drop it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Back there, you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh, I hate it when people take their sweet time beating around the bush, so I'll just ask!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, why did you move to protect me when we fell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And that Victorian guy, what was he talking about? Something to do with who somebody is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rosalind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know you might find what I'm about to say hard to accept, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tatyana and I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your mother and I met on the summit of this mountain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... and mamochka... you mean, you're..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rosalind, you're my daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A most unusual guest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What business has you hurrying over here today, Ratatos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must know exactly what it is, Enciodes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure we can fool that Victorian Trilby Asher with our bait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The smarter a man is, the more confident he is in his own judgement, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Enciodes, here's a warning for you too. Don't underestimate people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That Victorian spy seems to be pretty misled. He's chasing Arctosz's daughter all right, but I don't think things are gonna keep going that smoothly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if he doesn't go according to your plans? How are you gonna handle that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must have some sort of backup plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Arctosz's daughter deciding to return to Kjerag now is indeed outside the scope of our plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course, I couldn't possibly think such an improvised plan would suffice to solve our problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It sounds like you have something up your sleeve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me see... why haven't I seen Gnosis today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And the bodyguard always at your side. I heard from my sister and brother-in-law she hasn't been helping you train your Tschäggättä recently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You get your information fast, Ratatos."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gnosis and Degenbrecher naturally have their own jobs to do, and if you're here to see them today, I'm afraid you'll have to leave disappointed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not looking for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although... ah, yes. I had a piece of 'good news' for Gnosis, if he was here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing major, you'll know all about it tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He's said this before, but I'll personally remind you, Enciodes. You'd better be certain of the things happening below Kjeragandr's statue..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not just about one Clan Silverash. You'd do well to remember that us Browntails also have a stake in it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's etched into my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether it be the tri-clans or the Vine-Bead Court led by the Saintess..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ratatos, you should hold a little more confidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether it be in you, me, Gnosis, or even Degenbrecher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All that we do here is for Kjerag's future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That is my firm belief."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Run enough laps yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Also, I must retrieve my words from earlier, Madam Degenbrecher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's come into your clever little mind now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Black Knight indeed does not lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A brazen misunderstanding on my part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought young Larina was the key to the plans unfolding in Kjerag..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Were it not for that, I wouldn't have the slightest intention of establishing contact, and yet so many clues have appeared..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Madam, you did not come to block me from approaching Arctosz or Rosalind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're here to deepen the misunderstanding, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Done talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Smart people always talk so much. I don't get why. I can't be bothered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, pick up your weapon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me see how sharp Victoria's claws are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, no, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I surrender."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there a need for us to fight? This is a complete misunderstanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were right, I should head down the mountain for lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Trilby Asher calmly raises his hands and walks past Degenbrecher.\nBut as his back faces hers, he suddenly stops moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is only a little guess of mine, Madam Degenbrecher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To the best of my knowledge, Enciodes is not one to act without purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If Madam Larina is truly uninvolved, I believe he wouldn't use her as bait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is certainly not suspicious. So, could it be the Paleroche clan behind her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could it be... there's something amiss with the Paleroche spirits, or rather, the transport route they arranged for the alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Madam Larina's appearance was an unexpected affair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And it is precisely because of that, you worry that once I meet her, I might just stumble upon Clan Paleroche in the course of my investigation and discover something I shouldn't have."
