    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I believe my guess is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Degenbrecher wields her weapons with no mercy in mind, but the Trilby Asher is one step ahead of her.\nHe dodges the blast waves, the snow flying everywhere, and her murderous intent as he leaps down the mountain.\nDegenbrecher gives chase."
